msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Dejinta Guud"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service Check Name"
msgstr "Magaca Hubinta Adeegga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The name that is displayed for this Service Check, and is included in any Alert notifications."
msgstr "Magaca loo soo bandhigo Hubintan Adeegga, laguna daro ogeysiisyada qaylo-dhaanta kasta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many attempts"
msgstr "Immisa isku day"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Cacti attempts to run each test multiple times. The first successful attempt ends the testing and records the success. If none of the attempts are successful, the test is terminated and a failure is recorded. High number causes log test duration."
msgstr "Cacti wuxuu isku dayaa inuu tijaabo kasta socodsiiyo dhowr jeer. Isku-dayga ugu horreeya ee guulaysta ayaa soo afjara tijaabada oo diiwaangeliya guusha. Haddii midkoodna isku-dayada uusan guulaysan, tijaabada waa la joojiyaa waxaana la diiwaangeliyaa guuldarro. Tiro badan waxay keentaa muddo dheer oo tijaabo ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable test"
msgstr "Hawlgeli tijaabada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Uncheck this box to disable this test from being checked."
msgstr "Ka saar calaamadda sanduuqan si aad u joojiso hubinta tijaabadan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enable run script for this test"
msgstr "Hawlgeli socodsiinta qoraal-barnaamijka tijaabadan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the global Command Execution function is enabled, you can set here whether the script should be run for this test or not."
msgstr "Haddii shaqada guud ee Fulinta Amarka ay tahay mid La hawlgeliyay, waxaad halkan ku dejin kartaa in qoraalka (script) loo fuliyo tijaabadan iyo in kale."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller"
msgstr "Xog-uruuriye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Poller on which the test will run"
msgstr "Xog-uruuriyaha uu tijaabadu ku shaqayn doonto"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Type of service"
msgstr "Nooca adeegga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "What type of service?"
msgstr "Noocee ah adeeggu?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "IP Address or DNS name of server"
msgstr "Ciwaanka IP ama magaca DNS ee server-ka"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "You can specify another port (example.com:5000) otherwise default will be used. For IPv6 numeric address use [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use here name of server (example 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"
msgstr "Waxaad cayimi kartaa deked kale (example.com:5000) haddii kale tan caadiga ah ayaa la adeegsan doonaa. Ciwaanka tirooyinka ah ee IPv6 u isticmaal [ip:ad:dr:es:fo:rma:at]. DOH (DNS over HTTPS) halkan ku isticmaal magaca adeegaha (tusaale 10.10.10.10, cloudflare-dns.com, ..)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Resolve DNS to Address"
msgstr "U beddel DNS Cinwaan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Enter an IP Address to force DNS name to resolve to. Leaving blank will use DNS Resolution instead."
msgstr "Geli Ciwaanka IP si loogu qasbo magaca DNS inuu u xalliyo. Bannaanka oo loo daayo waxaa la adeegsan doonaa Xallinta DNS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Service settings"
msgstr "Dejinta adeegga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Select correct credential"
msgstr "Dooro aqoonsiga saxda ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP OID"
msgstr "SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SNMP OID"
msgstr "Geli SNMP OID"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH command"
msgstr "Amarka SSH"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Insert SSH command with full path, result of command will be returned"
msgstr "Geli amarka SSH oo leh waddada buuxda, natiijada amarka ayaa la soo celin doonaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Your own CA and intermediate certs"
msgstr "Shahaadooyinkaaga CA iyo kuwa dhexdhexaadka ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP Search"
msgstr "Raadinta LDAP"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search filter, it could be ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"
msgstr "Shaandheeyaha raadinta LDAP, wuxuu noqon karaa ,OU=anygroup,DC=example,DC=com"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS Name for Query"
msgstr "Magaca DNS ee Weydiinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "DNS name for querying. For DOH (DNS over HTTPS) use /resolve?name=example.com or /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. For plaintext DNS A and AAAA records will be returned"
msgstr "Magaca DNS ee weydiinta. Wixii DOH ah (DNS dul mara HTTPS) isticmaal /resolve?name=example.com ama /dns-query?name=example.com&type=A. Wixii qoraal cad ah, diiwaannada DNS A iyo AAAA ayaa la soo celin doonaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Path Part of URL"
msgstr "Qaybta Jidka ee URL"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "For web service insert at least \"/\" or something like \"/any/path/\"."
msgstr "Adeegga shabakadda geli ugu yaraan \"/\" ama wax la mid ah \"/dariiq/kasta/\"."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requires Authentication"
msgstr "Wuxuu U Baahan Yahay Xaqiijin"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check this box if the site will normally return a 401 Error as it requires a username and password."
msgstr "Calaamadee sanduuqan haddii goobta ay caadiyan soo celiso Khalad 401 ah maadaama ay u baahan tahay magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy Server"
msgstr "Adeegaha Wakiilka (Proxy)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If this connection text requires a proxy, select it here.  Otherwise choose 'None'."
msgstr "Haddii qoraalkan isku xirku uu u baahan yahay wakiil (proxy), halkan ka dooro. Haddii kale dooro 'Midna'."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check Certificate"
msgstr "Hubi Shahaadada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to validate the certificate. Default on, turn off if you the site uses a self-signed certificate."
msgstr "Haddii la isticmaalayo SSL, calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad xaqiijiso shahaadada. Sida caadiga ah way shidan tahay, dami haddii Goobtu ay isticmaasho shahaado ay iyadu iska saxeexday."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Check and notify Certificate expiration"
msgstr "Hubi oo ogeysii dhicitaanka Shahaadada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If using SSL, check this box if you want to check the certificate expiration. You can set in settings how many days before expiration notify.."
msgstr "Haddii la isticmaalayo SSL, calaamadee sanduuqan haddii aad rabto inaad hubiso dhicitaanka shahaadada. Waxaad ku dejin kartaa Dejinta inta maalmood ee ka hor dhicitaanka la ogeysiiyo.."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Parameters"
msgstr "Halbeegyada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How Often to Test"
msgstr "Inta Jeer ee La Tijaabiyo"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Test every xth poller run"
msgstr "Tijaabi orod kasta oo x-aad ee xog-ururiyaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Trigger"
msgstr "Kiciye"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the service must be DOWN before an alert email is triggered."
msgstr "Immisa jeer ayay tahay in adeeggu ahaado mid MAQAN (DOWN) ka hor inta aan la kicin iimayl digniin ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Long duration alert"
msgstr "Digniinta muddada dheer"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "If the test time is greater than this value more times in a row, send a notification. Related to variable Duration count. The test inherits the maximum runtime from the settings. If a higher value is set here, the maximum runtime is this value + 2 seconds."
msgstr "Haddii waqtiga tijaabada uu ka weyn yahay qiimahan dhowr jeer oo isku xigta, dir ogeysiis. Waxay la xiriirtaa doorsoomaha tirada Muddada. Tijaabadu waxay ka dhaxashaa waqtiga ugu badan ee socodka dejinta. Haddii qiime ka sarreeya halkan lagu dejiyo, waqtiga ugu badan ee socodku waa qiimahan + 2 ilbiriqsi."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Number of duration violations in a row"
msgstr "Tirada xadgudubyada muddada ah ee isku xiga"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "How many times the duration trigger must be exceeded in a row for a notification to be sent"
msgstr "Immisa jeer oo isku xigta ayay tahay in laga gudbo kicinta muddada si ogeysiis loo diro"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Verification Strings"
msgstr "Xarfaha Xaqiijinta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String"
msgstr "Xarigga Raadinta Jawaabta"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for in the response for a live and working service."
msgstr "Kani waa xarfo-taxaha laga raadinayo jawaabta adeeg nool oo shaqeynaya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Maintenance"
msgstr "Xarigga Raadinta Jawaabta - Dayactir"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is the string to search for on the Maintenance .  The Service Check will check for this string if the above string is not found.  If found, it means that the service is under maintenance."
msgstr "Kani waa xarfo-taxaha laga raadinayo bogga Dayactirka. Hubinta Adeeggu waxay eegi doontaa xarfo-taxahan haddii aan la helin xarfo-taxaha sare. Haddii la helo, waxay ka dhigan tahay in adeeggu uu ku jiro dayactir."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Response Search String - Failed"
msgstr "Xarigga Raadinta Jawaabta - Wuu Fashilmay"

#: includes/arrays.php
