#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "<b>Can be used for a lot of service checks:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - optional, when it is set, try HTTP basic auth<br/><i>SMTP on port 587</i> - optional. Without a username/password, only the server response is tested. With a username and password, login is also performed<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - optional. For anonymous ftp, use username \"anonymous\" and email address as password<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - required<br/><i>MQTT</i> - optional<br/><i>SCP, SSH command</i> - you can use this method or private key method"
msgstr "<b>Waxaa loo isticmaali karaa hubinta adeegyo badan:</b><br/><i>Http/https</i> - ikhtiyaari, marka la dejiyo, isku day xaqiijinta aasaasiga ah ee HTTP<br/><i>SMTP ee dekedda 587</i> - ikhtiyaari. Haddii aan la gelin magac isticmaale/eray sir ah, waxaa la tijaabiyaa jawaabta server-ka oo keliya. Haddii la geliyo magac isticmaale iyo eray sir ah, galitaanka sidoo kale waa la sameeyaa<br/><i>Imap, imaps, pop3, pop3s, ftp</i> - ikhtiyaari. Ftp-ga aan la aqoonin, u isticmaal magaca isticmaalaha \"anonymous\" iyo ciwaanka iimaylka sidii erayga sirta ah<br/><i>LDAP, smb, smbs</i> - waajib ah<br/><i>MQTT</i> - ikhtiyaari<br/><i>SCP, amarka SSH</i> - waxaad isticmaali kartaa habkan ama habka furaha gaarka ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Basic HTTP auth. Username and password are required"
msgstr "Rest API - Xaqiijinta Aasaasiga ah ee HTTP. Magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah waa loo baahan yahay"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - API key auth<br/>Auth is sent in HTTP header, custom header or POST method. Credentials in URL are not supported.<br/>Insert API key name and value. Both values are required. For HTTP header the name <i>Bearer or apikey or \"\"</i> is usually used (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). For custom header <i>X-API-Key</i> is usually used (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). For POST <i>api_key</i> is usually used."
msgstr "Rest API - Xaqiijinta furaha API<br/>Xaqiijinta waxaa lagu diraa madaxa HTTP, madax gaar ah ama habka POST. Aqoonsiyada ku jira URL lama taageero.<br/>Geli magaca iyo qiimaha furaha API. Labada qiimaba waa loo baahan yahay. Madaxa HTTP waxaa badanaa la adeegsadaa magaca <i>Bearer ama apikey ama \"\"</i> (Authorization: Bearer apivalue). Madaxa gaarka ah waxaa badanaa la adeegsadaa <i>X-API-Key</i> (X-Api-Key: keyvalue). POST waxaa badanaa la adeegsadaa <i>api_key</i>."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - OAuth2/Bearer token auth<br/>You can have key/token from server and insert it here or use auth flow with credentials. Username and password are sent Json encoded."
msgstr "Rest API - Xaqiijinta calaamadda OAuth2/Bearer<br/>Waxaad ka heli kartaa furaha/calaamadda adeegaha oo halkan geli kartaa ama waxaad isticmaali kartaa socodka xaqiijinta leh aqoonsiyo. Magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah waxaa loo diraa iyagoo Json ku qoran."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Rest API - Cookie based auth - both values are required. After login, cookie is returned"
msgstr "Rest API - Xaqiijinta ku saleysan Cookie - labada qiimaba waa loo baahan yahay. Gelitaanka kadib, cookie ayaa la soo celiyaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v1 or v2 - required, insert community name here"
msgstr "SNMP v1 ama v2 - waa lagama maarmaan, halkan geli magaca bulshada"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SNMP v3 - The security level determines which parameters are required"
msgstr "SNMP v3 - Heerka amnigu wuxuu go'aamiyaa cabbirrada loo baahan yahay"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSH private key - Can be used for SCP or SSH command test. These test can use username/password too"
msgstr "Furaha gaarka ah ee SSH - Waxaa loo isticmaali karaa tijaabada SCP ama amarka SSH. Tijaabooyinkani waxay sidoo kale isticmaali karaan magaca isticmaalaha/erayga sirta ah"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the web server is responding. If username/password credential is used, it will try Basic HTTP auth."
msgstr "Waxay kaliya hubisaa haddii server-ka webku uu jawaabayo. Haddii aqoonsiga magaca isticmaalaha/erayga sirta ah la isticmaalo, waxay isku dayi doontaa xaqiijinta Basic HTTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as HTTP plaintext but adds the ability to test certificates."
msgstr "Wuxuu la mid yahay qoraalka cad ee HTTP laakiin wuxuu ku darayaa awoodda lagu tijaabiyo shahaadooyinka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "It only checks whether the SMTP server is responding. No authentication. You will see server login banner and ehlo response."
msgstr "Waxay kaliya hubisaa haddii server-ka SMTP uu jawaabayo. Xaqiijin ma jirto. Waxaad arki doontaa calanka gelitaanka server-ka iyo jawaabta ehlo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted + STARTTLS. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. Without username and password, you will see server login banner and ehlo response. With credential, login will be performed"
msgstr "Aan la siraynin + STARTTLS. Sidoo kale waa suurtogal in la tijaabiyo ansaxnimada shahaadada. Haddii aadan gelin magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah, waxaad arki doontaa calanka gelitaanka adeegaha iyo jawaabta ehlo. Haddii aad geliso xogta aqoonsiga, gelitaanka waa la samayn doonaa"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted connection on default port 465. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate. With username and password AUTH LOGIN will be tested."
msgstr "Xiriirka siraysan ee dekedda caadiga ah 465. Waxaa sidoo kale suurtogal ah in la tijaabiyo ansaxnimada shahaadada. Iyadoo la adeegsanayo magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah waxaa la tijaabin doonaa AUTH LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted IMAP connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages. You can use AUTHENTICATE PLAIN or AUTHENTICATE LOGIN method."
msgstr "Xiriir IMAP oo aan la siraynin. Xog aqoonsi la'aan, xiriirka oo keliya ayaa la tijaabin doonaa. Waxaad arki doontaa calanka gelitaanka oo keliya. Xogta aqoonsiga waxaa lagu tijaabin doonaa gelitaanka waxaana la isku dayi doonaa in la akhriyo liiska fariimaha. Waxaad adeegsan kartaa habka AUTHENTICATE PLAIN ama AUTHENTICATE LOGIN."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted IMAP but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Wuxuu la mid yahay IMAP aan qarsoonayn laakiin gelitaanka ka dib waxaa la isticmaalaa STARTTLS. Waxaa sidoo kale suurtagal ah in la tijaabiyo ansaxnimada shahaadada ka dib STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted IMAP, you can try login and test certificate and user login"
msgstr "IMAP siraysan, waxaad isku dayi kartaa gelitaanka oo aad tijaabin kartaa shahaadada iyo gelitaanka isticmaalaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted POP3 connection. Without credential, only connection will be tested. You will see only login banner. With credential login will be tested and try to read list of messages"
msgstr "Xiriir POP3 oo aan la siraynin. Xog aqoonsi la'aan, xiriirka oo keliya ayaa la tijaabin doonaa. Waxaad arki doontaa calanka gelitaanka oo keliya. Xogta aqoonsiga waxaa lagu tijaabin doonaa gelitaanka waxaana la isku dayi doonaa in la akhriyo liiska fariimaha"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The same as unencrypted POP3 but after login STARTTLS is used. It is also possible to test the validity of the certificate after STARTTLS."
msgstr "Wuxuu la mid yahay POP3 aan qarsoonayn laakiin gelitaanka ka dib waxaa la isticmaalaa STARTTLS. Waxaa sidoo kale suurtagal ah in la tijaabiyo ansaxnimada shahaadada ka dib STARTTLS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted POP3, you can try login and test certificate and user login."
msgstr "POP3 siraysan, waxaad isku dayi kartaa gelitaanka oo aad tijaabin kartaa shahaadada iyo gelitaanka isticmaalaha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to resolve DNS record on specified DNS server"
msgstr "Isku day inaad xalliso diiwaanka DNS ee ku yaal adeegeha DNS ee la cayimay"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try DNS over HTTPS."
msgstr "Isku day DNS ee HTTPS dul saaran."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform unencrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Dhammaan cabbirrada waa loo baahan yahay. Samee galitaan iyo raadin LDAP oo aan siraysnayn"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All parameters are required. Perform encrypted LDAP login and search"
msgstr "Dhammaan cabbirrada waa loo baahan yahay. Samee galitaan iyo raadin LDAP oo siraysan"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unencrypted FTP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt). For anonymous connection use login *anonymous* and email address as password. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Xiriir FTP oo aan la siraynin, gal oo isku day inaad soo dejiso faylka lagu qeexay jidka (/path/to/file.txt). Xiriir qarsoon awgiis adeegso gelitaanka *anonymous* iyo ciwaanka iimaylka sidii erayga sirta ah. Waxaa la soo celin doonaa waxa ku jira faylka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt) from TFTP server. The content of the file is returned."
msgstr "Isku day inaad ka soo dejiso faylka ku xusan waddada (/path/to/file.txt) adeege TFTP. Waxa ku jira faylka ayaa la soo celinayaa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Encrypted SCP connection, login and try to download file specified in path (/path/to/file.txt)."
msgstr "Xiriirka SCP ee siraysan, gal oo isku day inaad soo dejiso faylka ku xusan jidka (/path/to/file.txt)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SMB protocol, username and password are required. Try to login and download file."
msgstr "Isku day hab-maamuuska SMB, magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah waa loo baahan yahay. Isku day inaad gasho oo aad soo dejiso faylka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Connect to MQTT server and listen for any message. You can specify topic in Path (bedroom/temp), blank for any topic. For this test is recommended increase \"Long duration alert\""
msgstr "Ku xidh server-ka MQTT oo dhegayso fariin kasta. Waxaad ku cayimi kartaa mawduuca Path (bedroom/temp), bannaan u daa mawduuc kasta. Imtixaankan waxaa lagula talinayaa in la kordhiyo \"Long duration alert\""

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with basic HTTP auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Tijaabada REST API ee leh xaqiijinta aasaasiga ah ee HTTP. Marka hore diyaari aqoonsiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with API key auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Tijaabada REST API ee leh xaqiijinta furaha API. Marka hore diyaari aqoonsiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with Oauth2. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Tijaabada REST API ee leh Oauth2. Marka hore diyaari aqoonsiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "REST API test with cookie auth. Prepare credential first."
msgstr "Tijaabada REST API ee leh xaqiijinta cookie. Marka hore diyaari aqoonsiga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP get method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Isku day habka SNMP get. Wax-soo-saarka OID-ga la cayimay ayaa la soo celinayaa. Aqoonsi ayaa loo baahan yahay, waa inaad marka hore diyaarisaa aqoonsiga SNMP v.1,2 ama v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Try SNMP walk method. Output for specified OID is returned. Credential is required, you have to prepare SNMP v.1,2 or v3 credential first."
msgstr "Isku day habka SNMP walk. Wax-soo-saarka OID-ga la cayimay ayaa la soo celinayaa. Aqoonsi ayaa loo baahan yahay, waa inaad marka hore diyaarisaa aqoonsiga SNMP v.1,2 ama v3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Use ssh and connect to remote host. After login run specified command and return output. Username and password or private key is possible."
msgstr "Isticmaal SSH oo ku xidhnow martigeliyaha fog. Ka dib marka aad gasho, socodsii amarka la cayimay oo soo celi natiijada. Magaca isticmaalaha iyo erayga sirta ah ama furaha gaarka ah waa suurtagal."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SFTP protocol on port 22, username and password and path are required. Try to do directory listing of path."
msgstr "Hab-maamuuska SFTP ee dekedda 22, magaca isticmaalaha, erayga sirta ah iyo jidka ayaa loo baahan yahay. Isku day inaad samayso liiska galka ee jidka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "All fine. Proceed as usual."
msgstr "Wax walba way fiican yihiin. Sida caadiga ah u sii wad."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL you passed to libcurl used a protocol that this libcurl does not support. The support might be a compile-time option that you did not use, it can be a misspelled protocol string or just a protocol libcurl has no code for."
msgstr "URL-ka aad u gudbisay libcurl wuxuu isticmaalay borotokool uusan libcurl-kani taageerin. Taageeradu waxay noqon kartaa ikhtiyaar wakhtiga isku-dubaridka (compile-time) oo aadan isticmaalin, waxay noqon kartaa xaraf borotokool oo si khaldan loo qoray ama borotokool uusan libcurl wax kood ah u lahayn."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Early initialization code failed. This is likely to be an internal error or problem, or a resource problem where something fundamental could not get done at init time."
msgstr "Koodhka bilowga hore wuu fashilmay. Tani waxay u badan tahay inay tahay qalad gudaha ah ama dhibaato, ama dhibaato khayraad oo wax aasaasi ah lagu samayn waayay waqtiga bilowga."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The URL was not properly formatted."
msgstr "URL-ka si sax ah looma qaabayn."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A requested feature, protocol or option was not found built-in in this libcurl due to a build-time decision. This means that a feature or option was not enabled or explicitly disabled when libcurl was built and in order to get it to function you have to get a rebuilt libcurl."
msgstr "Astaamaha, borotokoolka ama ikhtiyaarka la codsaday lagama helin isagoo ku dhex dhisan libcurl-kan sababo la xiriira go'aan xilligii dhismaha la gaaray. Tani waxay ka dhigan tahay in astaanta ama ikhtiyaarka aan la hawlgelin ama si cad loo joojiyay markii la dhisayay libcurl, si uu u shaqeeyana waa inaad heshaa libcurl dib loo dhisay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve proxy. The given proxy host could not be resolved."
msgstr "Lama xallin karin wakiilka (proxy). Martigeliyaha proxy ee la bixiyay lama xallin karin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not resolve host. The given remote host was not resolved."
msgstr "Lama xallin karin martigeliyaha. Martigeliyaha fog ee la bixiyay lama xallin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to connect() to host or proxy."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay in connect() lala sameeyo martigeliyaha ama wakiilka (proxy)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server sent data libcurl could not parse. This error code was known as CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY before 7.51.0."
msgstr "Server-ku wuxuu soo diray xog uu libcurl kala saari kari waayay. Koodhkan khaladka waxaa loo yaqaanay CURLE_FTP_WEIRD_SERVER_REPLY ka hor 7.51.0."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "We were denied access to the resource given in the URL. For FTP, this occurs while trying to change to the remote directory."
msgstr "Waa naloo diiday gelitaanka kheyraadka lagu siiyay URL-ka. Dhanka FTP, tani waxay dhacdaa marka la isku dayayo in loo beddelo galka fog."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "While waiting for the server to connect back when an active FTP session is used, an error code was sent over the control connection or similar."
msgstr "Intii la sugayay in adeeguhu dib u xirmo marka la isticmaalayo fadhi FTP oo firfircoon, kood khalad ah ayaa la soo diray xiriirka koontaroolka ama wax la mid ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "After having sent the FTP password to the server, libcurl expects a proper reply. This error code indicates that an unexpected code was returned."
msgstr "Ka dib marka erayga sirta ah ee FTP loo diro serferka, libcurl waxay filaysaa jawaab sax ah. Koodhkan qaladku wuxuu muujinayaa in koodh aan la filayn la soo celiyay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "During an active FTP session while waiting for the server to connect, the CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (or the internal default) timeout expired."
msgstr "Intii lagu jiray fadhi FTP oo firfircoon iyadoo la sugayo in serferku ku xirmo, waqtiga CURLOPT_ACCEPTTIMEOUT_MS (ama midka caadiga ah ee gudaha) ayaa dhacay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Libcurl failed to get a sensible result back from the server as a response to either a PASV or a EPSV command. The server is flawed."
msgstr "Libcurl way ku guuldarraysatay inay adeegaha ka hesho natiijo macquul ah iyada oo ka jawaabaysa amarka PASV ama EPSV. Adeeguhu cilad ayuu leeyahay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "FTP servers return a 227-line as a response to a PASV command. If libcurl fails to parse that line, this return code is passed back."
msgstr "Adeegayaasha FTP waxay soo celiyaan xarriiq 227 ah oo jawaab u ah amarka PASV. Haddii libcurl uu ku guuldareysto inuu fasiro xarriiqdaas, koodhkan soo celinta ayaa dib loo soo celiyaa."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal failure to lookup the host used for the new connection."
msgstr "Fashil gudaha ah oo ku yimid raadinta martigeliyaha loo isticmaalay xiriirka cusub."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP2 framing layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Dhibaato ayaa laga helay lakabka qaabeynta HTTP2. Tani waa mid guud waxayna noqon kartaa mid ka mid ah dhowr dhibaato, ka eeg kaydka khaladka faahfaahinta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Received an error when trying to set the transfer mode to binary or ASCII."
msgstr "Khalad ayaa la helay markii la isku dayayay in habka wareejinta loo dejiyo binary ama ASCII."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file transfer was shorter or larger than expected. This happens when the server first reports an expected transfer size, and then delivers data that does not match the previously given size."
msgstr "Wareejinta faylku way ka gaabnayd ama ka weynayd sidii la filayay. Tani waxay dhacdaa marka server-ku marka hore sheego cabbirka wareejinta la filayo, ka dibna uu keeno xog aan u dhigmin cabbirkii hore loo sheegay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This was either a weird reply to a 'RETR' command or a zero byte transfer complete."
msgstr "Tani waxay ahayd jawaab yaab leh oo ku socota amarka 'RETR' ama gudbin eber bayt ah oo dhammaystiran."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Obsolete Error"
msgstr "Khalad Duugoobay"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Not used in modern versions."
msgstr "Laguma isticmaalo noocyada casriga ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When sending custom \"QUOTE\" commands to the remote server, one of the commands returned an error code that was 400 or higher (for FTP) or otherwise indicated unsuccessful completion of the command."
msgstr "Marka loo dirayo amarro gaar ah oo \"QUOTE\" ah adeegaha fog, mid ka mid ah amarradu wuxuu soo celiyay kood khalad ah oo ah 400 ama ka sareeya (ee FTP) ama si kale u tilmaamay dhammaystir aan guulaysan oo amarka ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is returned if CURLOPT_FAILONERROR is set true and the HTTP server returns an error code that is >= 400."
msgstr "Tani waxaa la soo celiyaa haddii CURLOPT_FAILONERROR loo dejiyo run oo adeegaha HTTP uu soo celiyo lambar cilad ah oo ah >= 400."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An error occurred when writing received data to a local file, or an error was returned to libcurl from a write callback."
msgstr "Khalad ayaa dhacay markii xogta la helay lagu qorayay fayl maxalli ah, ama khalad ayaa loo soo celiyay libcurl iyada oo laga keenay write callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed starting the upload. For FTP, the server typically denied the STOR command. The error buffer usually contains the server's explanation for this."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay bilaabista soo gelinta. Dhanka FTP, adeeguhu wuxuu badanaa diiday amarka STOR. Kaydka khaladku wuxuu badanaa ka kooban yahay sharraxaadda adeegaha ee arrintan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "There was a problem reading a local file or an error returned by the read callback."
msgstr "Waxaa jirtay dhibaato ka dhalatay akhrinta faylka maxalliga ah ama cilad ay soo celisay shaqada dib-u-yeerista akhrinta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A memory allocation request failed. This is serious badness and things are severely screwed up if this ever occurs."
msgstr "Codsiga qoondaynta xusuusta ayaa fashilmay. Tani waa arrin halis ah oo xun, waxyaabahana si daran ayay u kharribmeen haddii tani weligeed dhacdo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Operation timeout. The specified time-out period was reached according to the conditions."
msgstr "Waqtiga hawlgalku wuu dhammaaday. Muddadii waqti-dhammaadka ee la cayimay ayaa la gaaray iyadoo la raacayo shuruudaha."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP PORT command returned error. This mostly happens when you have not specified a good enough address for libcurl to use. See CURLOPT_FTPPORT."
msgstr "Amarka FTP PORT wuxuu soo celiyay cilad. Tani badanaa waxay dhacdaa marka aadan u cayimin cinwaan ku filan oo libcurl uu isticmaalo. Eeg CURLOPT_FTPPORT."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP REST command returned error. This should never happen if the server is sane."
msgstr "Amarka FTP REST wuxuu soo celiyay cilad. Tani marnaba ma dhici karto haddii adeeguhu si sax ah u shaqaynayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The server does not support or accept range requests."
msgstr "Server-ku ma taageero ama ma aqbalo codsiyada kala duwanaanta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This is an odd error that mainly occurs due to internal confusion."
msgstr "Tani waa cilad qariib ah oo inta badan dhacda sababo la xiriira jahawareer gudaha ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem occurred somewhere in the SSL/TLS handshake. You really want the error buffer and read the message there as it pinpoints the problem slightly more. Could be certificates (file formats, paths, permissions), passwords, and others."
msgstr "Dhibaato ayaa ka dhacday meel ka mid ah is-gacan-qaadka SSL/TLS. Waxaad runtii u baahan tahay kaydka khaladka oo aad akhridaa farriinta halkaas ku jirta maadaama ay dhibaatada si yar u sii tilmaamayso. Waxay noqon kartaa shahaadooyin (qaababka faylalka, jidadka, oggolaanshaha), erayo sir ah, iyo kuwo kale."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The download could not be resumed because the specified offset was out of the file boundary."
msgstr "Soo dejinta dib looma sii wadi karin sababtoo ah meesha la cayimay (offset) waxay ka baxsanayd xadka faylka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A file given with FILE:// could not be opened. Most likely because the file path does not identify an existing file. Did you check file permissions?"
msgstr "Fayl lagu bixiyay FILE:// lama furi karin. Waxay u badan tahay sababtoo ah jidka faylku ma tilmaamayo fayl jira. Ma hubisay oggolaanshaha faylka?"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP cannot bind. LDAP bind operation failed."
msgstr "LDAP ma xirmi karo. Hawlgalkii xiritaanka LDAP wuu fashilmay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "LDAP search failed."
msgstr "Raadintii LDAP way fashilantay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Function not found. A required zlib function was not found."
msgstr "Hawl lama helin. Hawl zlib ah oo loo baahan yahay lama helin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Aborted by callback. A callback returned \"abort\" to libcurl."
msgstr "Waxaa joojiyay dib-u-yeerid (callback). Dib-u-yeerid ayaa u soo celisay \"abort\" libcurl."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A function was called with a bad parameter."
msgstr "Hawl ayaa loogu yeeray halbeeg khaldan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Interface error. A specified outgoing interface could not be used. Set which interface to use for outgoing connections' source IP address with URLOPT_INTERFACE."
msgstr "Cilad isdhexgal. Isdhexgalka bixitaanka ee la cayimay lama isticmaali karin. U deji isdhexgalka la isticmaalayo ciwaanka IP-ga isha ee xiriirrada baxaya adigoo adeegsanaya URLOPT_INTERFACE."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Too many redirects. When following redirects, libcurl hit the maximum amount. Set your limit with CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."
msgstr "Wareejinno aad u badan. Markii la raacayay wareejinnada, libcurl wuxuu gaaray tirada ugu badan. Ku deji xadkaaga CURLOPT_MAXREDIRS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed to libcurl is not recognized/known. Refer to the appropriate documentation. This is most likely a problem in the program that uses libcurl. The error buffer might contain more specific information about which exact option it concerns."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaar loo gudbiyay libcurl lama aqoonsan/lama yaqaan. Tixraac dukumeentiyada ku habboon. Tani waxay u badan tahay inay dhibaato ku tahay barnaamijka adeegsada libcurl. Kaydka khaladku wuxuu yeelan karaa macluumaad gaar ah oo ku saabsan ikhtiyaarka dhabta ah ee uu khuseeyo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An option passed in to a setopt was wrongly formatted. See error message for details about what option."
msgstr "Ikhtiyaar loo gudbiyay setopt si khaldan ayaa loo qaabeeyay. Eeg fariinta khaladka si aad u hesho faahfaahin ku saabsan ikhtiyaarka."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Nothing was returned from the server, and under the circumstances, getting nothing is considered an error."
msgstr "Waxba kama soo noqon adeegaha, xaaladdan jirtana, in aan waxba la helin waxaa loo arkaa khalad."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The specified crypto engine was not found."
msgstr "Mashiinka sirta ee la cayimay lama helin."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed setting the selected SSL crypto engine as default."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay in mishiinka sirta SSL ee la doortay laga dhigo midka caadiga ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed sending network data."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay dirista xogta shabakadda."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failure with receiving network data."
msgstr "Fashil ku yimid helitaanka xogta shabakadda."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "problem with the local client certificate."
msgstr "dhibaato ayaa ka jirta shahaadada macmiilka maxalliga ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Could not use specified cipher."
msgstr "Lama isticmaali karin cipher-ka la cayimay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server's SSL certificate or SSH fingerprint was deemed not OK. This error code has been unified with CURLE_SSL_CACERT since 7.62.0. Its previous value was 51."
msgstr "Shahaadada SSL ama faraha SSH ee server-ka fog looma arag mid hagaagsan. Koodhkan khaladka waxaa lagu mideeyay CURLE_SSL_CACERT tan iyo 7.62.0. Qiimihiisii hore wuxuu ahaa 51."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unrecognized transfer encoding."
msgstr "Hab-codaynta wareejinta aan la aqoonsan."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Maximum file size exceeded."
msgstr "Cabbirka faylka ee ugu badan waa la dhaafay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Requested FTP SSL level failed."
msgstr "Heerka FTP SSL ee la codsaday wuu fashilmay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "When doing a send operation curl had to rewind the data to retransmit, but the rewinding operation failed."
msgstr "Marka la samaynayo hawlgal diris ah, curl waxay ku qasbanaatay inay dib u celiso xogta si ay dib ugu dirto, laakiin hawlgalkii dib u celinta wuu fashilmay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Initiating the SSL Engine failed."
msgstr "Bilowga Mishiinka SSL wuu fashilmay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The remote server denied curl to login (Added in 7.13.1)"
msgstr "Server-ka fog wuxuu u diiday curl inuu galo (Waxaa lagu daray 7.13.1)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File not found on TFTP server."
msgstr "Faylka lagama helin adeegaha TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Permission problem on TFTP server."
msgstr "Dhibaato ogolaansho oo ka jirta server-ka TFTP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Out of disk space on the server."
msgstr "Booskii saxanka (disk) ee adeegaha wuu dhammaaday."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Illegal TFTP operation."
msgstr "Hawlgal TFTP ah oo aan sharci ahayn."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unknown TFTP transfer ID."
msgstr "Aqoonsiga wareejinta TFTP aan la aqoon."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "File already exists and is not overwritten."
msgstr "Faylku horay ayuu u jiray mana dul-qorayo."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "This error should never be returned by a properly functioning TFTP server."
msgstr "Ciladdan marna ma aha inuu soo celiyo adeegaha TFTP ee si sax ah u shaqeynaya."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Problem with reading the SSL CA cert (path? access rights?)"
msgstr "Dhibaato ayaa ka jirta akhrinta shahaadada SSL CA (jidka? xuquuqda gelitaanka?)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The resource referenced in the URL does not exist."
msgstr "Kheyraadka lagu tixraacay URL-ka ma jiro."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An unspecified error occurred during the SSH session."
msgstr "Khalad aan la cayimin ayaa dhacay intii lagu jiray fadhiga SSH."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to shut down the SSL connection."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay in la damiyo xiriirka SSL."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Socket is not ready for send/recv wait till it's ready and try again. This return code is only returned from curl_easy_recv and curl_easy_send (Added in 7.18.2)"
msgstr "Socket diyaar uma aha dirista/helidda sug ilaa uu diyaar noqdo oo mar kale isku day. Koodhkan soo noqoshada waxaa keliya laga soo celiyaa curl_easy_recv iyo curl_easy_send (Waxaa lagu daray 7.18.2)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to load CRL file (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay soo raridda faylka CRL (Waxaa lagu daray 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Issuer check failed (Added in 7.19.0)"
msgstr "Hubinta bixiyuhu way fashilantay (Waxaa lagu daray 7.19.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "The FTP server does not understand the PRET command at all or does not support the given argument. Be careful when using CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, a custom LIST command is sent with the PRET command before PASV as well. (Added in 7.20.0)"
msgstr "Adeegaha FTP gabi ahaanba ma fahmo amarka PRET ama ma taageero doodda la siiyay. Ka taxaddar marka aad isticmaalayso CURLOPT_CUSTOMREQUEST, amar LIST oo gaar ah ayaa sidoo kale lala diraa amarka PRET ka hor PASV. (Waxaa lagu daray 7.20.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP CSeq numbers."
msgstr "Iswaafajin la'aanta tirooyinka RTSP CSeq."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Mismatch of RTSP Session Identifiers."
msgstr "Iswaafajin la'aanta Aqoonsiyada Kalfadhiga RTSP."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Unable to parse FTP file list (during FTP wildcard downloading)."
msgstr "Suurtogal ma aha in la fasilo liiska faylasha FTP (intii lagu jiray soo dejinta FTP wildcard)."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Chunk callback reported error."
msgstr "Wicitaanka dib-u-celinta qaybta wuxuu soo sheegay cilad."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "(For internal use only, is never returned by libcurl) No connection available, the session is queued. (added in 7.30.0)"
msgstr "(Isticmaalka gudaha oo keliya, marnaba ma soo celiyo libcurl) Xiriir ma jiro, fadhiga waxaa la geliyay safka. (lagu daray 7.30.0)"

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Failed to match the pinned key specified with CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."
msgstr "Waa lagu guuldareystay in la waafajiyo furaha la xiray ee lagu qeexay CURLOPT_PINNEDPUBLICKEY."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Status returned failure when asked with CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."
msgstr "Xaaladdu waxay soo celisay fashil markii la weydiiyay CURLOPT_SSL_VERIFYSTATUS."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Stream error in the HTTP/2 framing layer."
msgstr "Khalad qulqul oo ka dhacay lakabka qaabeynta HTTP/2."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An API function was called from inside a callback."
msgstr "Hawl API ah ayaa laga wacay gudaha callback."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An authentication function returned an error."
msgstr "Hawl xaqiijin ah ayaa soo celisay khalad."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "A problem was detected in the HTTP/3 layer. This is somewhat generic and can be one out of several problems, see the error buffer for details."
msgstr "Dhibaato ayaa laga helay lakabka HTTP/3. Tani waa mid guud waxayna noqon kartaa mid ka mid ah dhowr dhibaato, ka eeg kaydka khaladka faahfaahinta."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "QUIC connection error. This error may be caused by an SSL library error. QUIC is the protocol used for HTTP/3 transfers."
msgstr "Khalad xiriirka QUIC. Khaladkan waxaa sababi kara khalad maktabadda SSL ah. QUIC waa borotokoolka loo isticmaalo wareejinta HTTP/3."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "Proxy handshake error. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR provides extra details on the specific problem."
msgstr "Khalad gacan-qaadista Proxy. CURLINFO_PROXY_ERROR waxay bixisaa faahfaahin dheeraad ah oo ku saabsan dhibaatada gaarka ah."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "SSL Client Certificate required."
msgstr "Shahaadada Macaamiisha SSL ayaa loo baahan yahay."

#: includes/arrays.php
msgid "An internal call to poll() or select() returned error that is not recoverable."
msgstr "Wacitaan gudaha ah oo loo diray poll() ama select() wuxuu soo celiyay khalad aan laga soo kabsan karin."

