#: setup.php
msgid "The User-Agent string sent with HTTP/HTTPS and other cURL based service checks. Some sites block old or uncommon browsers, so you can set a current User-Agent here. Leave blank to use the built-in default."
msgstr "Xarafka User-Agent ee lala diro hubinta adeegga HTTP/HTTPS iyo kuwa kale ee ku salaysan cURL. Goobaha qaarkood waxay xiraan daalacashada duugga ah ama aan caadiga ahayn, markaa waxaad halkan ku dejin kartaa User-Agent casri ah. Bannaanka u daa si aad u isticmaasho ka caadiga ah ee ku dhex jira."

